gous recombination and crossing-over in meiotic prophase I in male and female germ cells (By similarity). Required for proper synaptonemal complex assembly and homologous chromosome pairing (By similarity). Requiref for recruitment TEX11 and MSH4 to recombination intermediates (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}